	(text_box "USB PROG: the FT2232H gives two USB channels through one cable. Channel A is the JTAG programmer\n(openFPGALoader -c ft2232), channel B the serial console, so the console stays open while a bitstream\nloads and the whole boot can be captured. Its USB-C also powers the board (VBUS to the power sheet).\nUSB USER: the second USB-C goes straight to FPGA pins (ULX3S style) for a soft USB device\n(full speed: 27 Ω series, 15 kΩ pull-downs, a 1.5 kΩ pull-up on D+ switched by an FPGA pin).\nGPDI is the ULX3S / Icepi 22 nF-coupled HDMI; its DDC I2C is level shifted to 5 V. The microSD is wired 4-bit with pull-ups."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 25.4 0)
		(size 124.46 13.97)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 194 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4b276a27-ed92-5b39-449a-d5f11b863bc5")
